  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/heygen-com/hyperframes/zipball/v0.9.22",
  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.9.22\n\nReleased on 2026-11-08.\n\nStudio previews look sharper: scrubbing shows full-quality decoded frames, and seeking no longer drops to an incomplete picture. Renders also keep page timers on the film's schedule at any worker count.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Studio:** Scrub full-quality video with decoded preview frames ([b7157bdab](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/b7157bdabbabb194f60126bca45cad21c263a7dc), [#7379](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7379)).\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Producer:** Keep page timers on the film's schedule at every worker count ([fed14b016](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/fed14b0161baa6edf170ba37e2fb4a0f4656a8f1), [#7390](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7390)).\n- **Core:** Retain complete preview pictures during native seeks ([b87a01f6a](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/b87a01f6a851b0ca02bfad3acfd0c56398024267), [#7378](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7378)).\n\n## Internal\n\n- **Producer:** The injector budget test no longer leaves a no-op injector for later tests ([34118d8f2](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/34118d8f20cf9682f119b157e89b2f3fe42cd4e4), [#7384](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7384)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.9.21...v0.9.22\n"
}
